{"reference":"1 Chronicles 20","book":"1 Chronicles","chapter":20,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"A Selective Retelling","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Chronicles does not include episodes such as David and Bathsheba, though Samuel preserves them. This omission need not be read as a denial; the retelling selects material in keeping with its own concerns for genealogy, temple, worship, and succession.","verse_refs":["1 Chronicles 20:1-8"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_1_chronicles_020_e635eda81484770797cd8f0d"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}